      "zh": "我们凡事都不叫人有妨碍，免得这职分被人毁谤；",
      "en": "We do not give anyone[NOTE:1] an occasion for taking an offense in anything,[NOTE:2] so that no fault may be found with our ministry.",
      "notes": [
        "The word “anyone” is not in the Greek text, but is implied. Direct objects in Greek were often omitted when clear from the context.",
